{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25873","headline":"上党奏庆云见 · 李绅","name":"上党奏庆云见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞龙久驭宇，真气尚兴云。\n五色传嘉瑞，千龄表圣君。\n从风忽萧索，依汉更氛氲。\n影彻天初霁，光鲜日未曛。\n表祥近自远，垂化聚还分。\n宁作无依者，空传陶令文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}